  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-7" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;6 - Issued: $6,000,000 Letter of Credit issued by American Electric Power Company, Inc. on behalf of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Appalachian Power Company, Inc. to benefit PJM Interconnection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; $6,000,000 Letter of Credit issued by American Electric Power Company, Inc. on behalf of Appalachian &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; Power Company, Inc. to benefit PJM Interconnection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;$347,700 Letter of Credit issued by American Electric Power Company, Inc. on behalf of Appalachian Power &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Company to benefit PJM Interconnection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
