  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;- 49 Appalachian Power Company employees represented by UMWA 5400 were provided with wage adders for travel pay, future GWIs determined, effective on February 19, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; 26 Appalachian Power Company employees represented by UWUA 544 were provided with wage adders for travel pay, future GWIs determined, effective on March 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
