20%"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:17.68pt"&gt;Amounts include counterparty netting of risk management and hedging contracts and associated cash collateral in accordance with the accounting guidance for &#8220;Derivatives and Hedging.&#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:9pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(c)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:18.13pt"&gt;All derivative contracts subject to a master netting arrangement or similar agreement are offset on the balance sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The table below presents APCo's activity of derivative risk management contracts:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:84.523%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:63.688%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.504%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:15.801%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.504%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:15.803%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="